    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      391.21,
      62.97,
      402.28
    ],
    "text": "To :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      409.21,
      341.16,
      444.28
    ],
    "text": "1. Maxwell Parakrama Paranagama Esquire2. Madam Dimingu Badathuruge Priyanthi Suranjana Vidyaratne3. Madam Mano Ramanathan",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      451.21,
      91.29,
      462.28
    ],
    "text": "Greetings :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      469.21,
      539.91,
      504.28
    ],
    "text": "Whereas, I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has in pursuance of theprovisions of Section 2 of the Commission of Inquiry Act (Chapter 393) appointed a Commission to inquiry by the Directivedated August 12, 2013 ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      511.21,
      488.04,
      522.28
    ],
    "text": "whereas, amendments and additions have been made to the said original Directive from time to time ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      529.21,
      539.67,
      552.28
    ],
    "text": "And whereas, five international experts have been appointed by me to serve on an Advisory Council to theCommission of Inquiry by the aforesaid amendments and additions ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      559.21,
      397.98,
      570.28
    ],
    "text": "And, the need for one more expert to be appointed has been identified by me ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      583.21,
      508.2,
      594.28
    ],
    "text": "I hereby appoint Motoo Noguchi Esquire, the international expert to serve on the said Advisory Council :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      601.21,
      539.85,
      624.28
    ],
    "text": "Given at Colombo under the seal of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka on this Twenty Forth day ofNovember, Two Thousand and Fourteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      281.85,
      631.21,
      419.0,
      642.28
    ],
    "text": "By Order of His Excellency,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      427.77,
      649.21,
      532.06,
      672.28
    ],
